<Behavior #work-ctrl-flow-engine apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" version="1" (
  <Requirements [
    <Requirement #suspend-resume (
      <Statement ?01M0NJZ4NDS5N8WMZWKC3QCWT4>
      WorkCtrlFlow 引擎 SHALL 在可中断节点（ExternalJob/Timer）处登记 WaitHandle、把状态按节点 invocationKey 保存到外部 Store 并返回 WAITING；经 ResumeSignal（含 resumeToken）恢复后从快照重放继续，已完成动作不重复执行副作用。
      </?01M0NJZ4NDS5N8WMZWKC3QCWT4>
      <Suites [
        <Suite { name = "suspend-resume" } (
          <Cases [
            <Case { name = "挂起" } (
              <Given ?01M0NJZ4NDS5N8WMZWKC3QCWT5>
              order-fulfillment demo
              </?01M0NJZ4NDS5N8WMZWKC3QCWT5>
              <When ?01M0NJZ4NDS5N8WMZWKC3QCWT6>
              start
              </?01M0NJZ4NDS5N8WMZWKC3QCWT6>
              <Then ?01M0NJZ4NDS5N8WMZWKC3QCWT7>
              WAITING，open handle 指向 pack，state.seed 已生效
              </?01M0NJZ4NDS5N8WMZWKC3QCWT7>
            )>
            <Case { name = "恢复到完成" } (
              <Given ?01M0NJZ4NDS5N8WMZWKC3QCWT8>
              已挂起实例
              </?01M0NJZ4NDS5N8WMZWKC3QCWT8>
              <When ?01M0NJZ4NDS5N8WMZWKC3QCWT9>
              resume(pack) → fireDueTimers
              </?01M0NJZ4NDS5N8WMZWKC3QCWT9>
              <Then ?01M0NJZ4NDS5N8WMZWKC3QCWTA>
              COMPLETED，payload 写入 assignTo，前序动作日志不重复
              </?01M0NJZ4NDS5N8WMZWKC3QCWTA>
            )>
            <Case { name = "跨实例恢复" } (
              <Given ?01M0NJZ4NDS5N8WMZWKC3QCWTB>
              FileStore + 全新引擎实例
              </?01M0NJZ4NDS5N8WMZWKC3QCWTB>
              <When ?01M0NJZ4NDS5N8WMZWKC3QCWTC>
              逐段恢复
              </?01M0NJZ4NDS5N8WMZWKC3QCWTC>
              <Then ?01M0NJZ4NDS5N8WMZWKC3QCWTD>
              COMPLETED（进程重启等价）
              </?01M0NJZ4NDS5N8WMZWKC3QCWTD>
            )>
          ]>
        )>
      ]>
    )>
    <Requirement #idempotent-signals (
      <Statement ?01M0NJZ4NDS5N8WMZWKC3QCWTE>
      ResumeSignal SHALL 幂等：重复投递已应用信号返回当前状态且不触发新 tick；resumeToken 不匹配或无对应 open handle 的信号被拒绝且流程状态不变。
      </?01M0NJZ4NDS5N8WMZWKC3QCWTE>
      <Suites [
        <Suite { name = "idempotent-signals" } (
          <Cases [
            <Case { name = "重复投递" } (
              <Given ?01M0NJZ4NDS5N8WMZWKC3QCWTF>
              已应用的信号
              </?01M0NJZ4NDS5N8WMZWKC3QCWTF>
              <When ?01M0NJZ4NDS5N8WMZWKC3QCWTG>
              再次 resume
              </?01M0NJZ4NDS5N8WMZWKC3QCWTG>
              <Then ?01M0NJZ4NDS5N8WMZWKC3QCWTH>
              状态与 tickNo 不变
              </?01M0NJZ4NDS5N8WMZWKC3QCWTH>
            )>
            <Case { name = "token 错误" } (
              <Given ?01M0NJZ4NDS5N8WMZWKC3QCWTJ>
              正确 kind/key + 错误 token
              </?01M0NJZ4NDS5N8WMZWKC3QCWTJ>
              <When ?01M0NJZ4NDS5N8WMZWKC3QCWTK>
              resume
              </?01M0NJZ4NDS5N8WMZWKC3QCWTK>
              <Then ?01M0NJZ4NDS5N8WMZWKC3QCWTM>
              抛 resume-token-mismatch，handle 仍 open
              </?01M0NJZ4NDS5N8WMZWKC3QCWTM>
            )>
            <Case { name = "无匹配" } (
              <Given ?01M0NJZ4NDS5N8WMZWKC3QCWTN>
              未知 signalKey
              </?01M0NJZ4NDS5N8WMZWKC3QCWTN>
              <When ?01M0NJZ4NDS5N8WMZWKC3QCWTP>
              resume
              </?01M0NJZ4NDS5N8WMZWKC3QCWTP>
              <Then ?01M0NJZ4NDS5N8WMZWKC3QCWTQ>
              抛 no-open-wait-handle
              </?01M0NJZ4NDS5N8WMZWKC3QCWTQ>
            )>
          ]>
        )>
      ]>
    )>
    <Requirement #interruption-equivalence (
      <Statement ?01M0NJZ4NDS5N8WMZWKC3QCWTR>
      从任意挂起点恢复后的最终 vars SHALL 与信号即时到达的执行等价（WF-6，副作用发生时刻除外）。
      </?01M0NJZ4NDS5N8WMZWKC3QCWTR>
      <Suites [
        <Suite { name = "interruption-equivalence" } (
          <Cases [
            <Case { name = "分段 vs 连续" } (
              <Given ?01M0NJZ4NDS5N8WMZWKC3QCWTS>
              同一 bundle 两条投递路径
              </?01M0NJZ4NDS5N8WMZWKC3QCWTS>
              <When ?01M0NJZ4NDS5N8WMZWKC3QCWTT>
              比较最终 vars
              </?01M0NJZ4NDS5N8WMZWKC3QCWTT>
              <Then ?01M0NJZ4NDS5N8WMZWKC3QCWTV>
              深度相等
              </?01M0NJZ4NDS5N8WMZWKC3QCWTV>
            )>
          ]>
        )>
      ]>
    )>
  ]>
)>
